Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,0:00:09.50,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,465)}H011  
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.50,0:00:09.50,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}姉の静かなアドバイス
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.78,0:01:52.98,Header,,0,0,0,,H011  •  状態動詞と動作動詞（進行形にならない動詞）
Dialogue: 2,0:00:10.78,0:00:15.54,English,,0,0,0,,My sister always chooses her words.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:15.54,0:00:21.78,English,,0,0,0,,She pauses quietly first, and then she speaks.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:21.78,0:00:29.66,English,,0,0,0,,Whenever she speaks, I recognize something deeply true in her voice.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.66,0:00:31.10,English,,0,0,0,,Do not rush.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:31.10,0:00:38.92,English,,0,0,0,,Being honest with your own emotions is the most important thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.92,0:00:45.10,English,,0,0,0,,Her advice is always gentle, but it moves my heart.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.10,0:00:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,When she listens, she shows patience.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.88,0:00:57.36,English,,0,0,0,,When I share an opinion, she takes time to consider it.
Dialogue: 2,0:00:57.36,0:01:03.24,English,,0,0,0,,Her opinion is always sincere and genuine.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.06,0:01:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,I hope I will one day have the calm and mature nature she has.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:11.60,0:01:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,She encourages me, and she truly does concern herself with my future.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.40,0:01:37.90,English,,0,0,0,,One evening she quietly remarked, A person can care for others only after they understand themselves.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.66,0:01:46.90,English,,0,0,0,,Her quiet but steady words stayed with me.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.52,0:01:52.78,English,,0,0,0,,Affection filled my chest gently.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.28,0:01:57.44,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,465)}H011  
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.28,0:01:57.44,TitleJa,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,575)}姉の静かなアドバイス
